\section{Rewriter Independence}
\label{app:rewriter_indep}

To test whether the verbosity Blindspot depends on the rewriter's identity, we replace Qwen3-32B with GPT-4o as the verbosity rewriter while keeping Qwen3-32B as judge (Table~\ref{tab:rewriter_indep}).
